(4\) Classical ML, stats, probability \(still asked frequently\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pearson vs Spearman) Tj
T*
(? Pearson: linear correlation on raw values.) Tj
T*
(? Spearman: rank correlation \(monotonic relationships, robust to outliers/non-normality\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLT use case) Tj
T*
(? Means/sums of many independent samples approximate normal; allows confidence intervals/tests) Tj
T*
(even if raw data non-normal \(with caveats\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Cross-validation) Tj
T*
(? Estimates generalization robustly on small/medium datasets.) Tj
T*
(? Use **stratified** for imbalance, **grouped/time-series CV** when IID assumption breaks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Random forest vs gradient boosting) Tj
T*
(? RF: bagging, parallel trees, variance reduction, robust baseline.) Tj
T*
(? GBM/XGBoost: sequential residual fitting, lower bias, often better accuracy, more tuning-) Tj
T*
(sensitive.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(K-means convergence nuance) Tj
T*
(? Objective \(within-cluster SSE\) monotonically decreases; converges to a **local** optimum.) Tj
T*
(? Not guaranteed unique/global optimum; sensitive to initialization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Imbalanced classes) Tj
T*
(? Use class weights, focal loss, threshold tuning, resampling, PR-AUC/F1/recall@precision) Tj
T*
(targets.) Tj
T*
(? Avoid reporting accuracy alone.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Long-tail data) Tj
T*
(? Majority classes dominate gradients.) Tj
T*
(? Use reweighting, resampling, decoupled head training, focal/class-balanced losses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5\) Experimentation and decision quality \(staff differentiator\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(A/B testing pitfalls) Tj
T*
(? Sample ratio mismatch, peeking, multiple comparisons, novelty effects, interference between) Tj
T*
(users.) Tj
T*
(? Staff answer includes pre-registered metrics + guardrails + stopping rule.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(P-value in plain language) Tj
T*
(? Probability of observing data this extreme \(or more\) **assuming null is true**.) Tj
T*
(? Not the probability that null is true.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Metric selection) Tj
T*
(? Match metric to business objective and failure costs.) Tj
T*
(? Track primary metric + guardrails \(latency, safety, fairness, cost\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Selection bias) Tj
T*
(? Data collection process distorts representativeness.) Tj
T*
ET

