(7\) SQL/Python coding mini-cheats) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SQL order of execution \(logical\)) Tj
T*
(`FROM -> JOIN -> WHERE -> GROUP BY -> HAVING -> SELECT -> ORDER BY -> LIMIT`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Common SQL gotchas) Tj
T*
(? `WHERE` filters rows pre-aggregation; `HAVING` filters groups post-aggregation.) Tj
T*
(? `BETWEEN` is inclusive; `IN` matches set membership.) Tj
T*
(? Prefer explicit joins over comma joins.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Python quick reminders) Tj
T*
(? `list`: mutable; `tuple`: immutable/hashable \(if elements hashable\).) Tj
T*
(? For set operations/intersection at scale, convert to `set` first.) Tj
T*
(? For duplicates: hash map / `collections.Counter` / sort+scan.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8\) Formula flashcards \(memorize\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(? **Cross-entropy \(binary\)**: \\\(-[y\\log p + \(1-y\)\\log\(1-p\)]\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **L2-regularized loss**: \\\(L = L_{\\text{data}} + \\lambda\\sum_i w_i^2\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **L1-regularized loss**: \\\(L = L_{\\text{data}} + \\lambda\\sum_i |w_i|\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **Softmax**: \\\(\\sigma\(z_i\)=\\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **Bayes rule**: \\\(P\(A|B\)=\\frac{P\(B|A\)P\(A\)}{P\(B\)}\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **Precision**: \\\(TP/\(TP+FP\)\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **Recall**: \\\(TP/\(TP+FN\)\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **F1**: \\\(2PR/\(P+R\)\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **Attention**: \\\(\\text{softmax}\(QK^\\top/\\sqrt{d_k}\)V\\\)) Tj
T*
(? **K-means objective**: \\\(\\sum_k\\sum_{x_i\\in C_k}\\|x_i-\\mu_k\\|^2\\\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
