() Tj
T*
(9\) Rapid-fire \(speak each in <=20 seconds\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Why random initialization? -> symmetry breaking.) Tj
T*
(2. Why mini-batch over full batch? -> throughput + stable enough gradients.) Tj
T*
(3. Pearson vs Spearman? -> linear vs rank-monotonic.) Tj
T*
(4. Why CE over MSE for classification? -> better gradients/probabilistic fit.) Tj
T*
(5. What is overfitting? -> memorization; poor generalization.) Tj
T*
(6. How to detect leakage? -> implausibly high CV, feature availability audit, time-based) Tj
T*
(holdout.) Tj
T*
(7. Random forest vs boosting? -> variance reduction vs bias reduction.) Tj
T*
(8. Why Q/K/V? -> relevance scoring separated from value aggregation.) Tj
T*
(9. Why transformer expensive? -> quadratic attention.) Tj
T*
(10. Why outputs vary for same prompt? -> sampling/randomness/backend nondeterminism.) Tj
T*
(11. What is mode collapse? -> generator loses diversity.) Tj
T*
(12. What is focal loss doing? -> downweights easy examples, focuses hard/minority samples.) Tj
T*
(13. K-means guaranteed global optimum? -> no, local optimum.) Tj
T*
(14. What is label smoothing? -> reduce overconfidence, improve calibration.) Tj
T*
(15. What is CLT and why useful? -> sampling mean approx normal for inference.) Tj
T*
(16. What is selection bias? -> non-representative sampling; invalid conclusions.) Tj
T*
(17. What is batch norm benefit? -> stabilizes and speeds training.) Tj
T*
(18. What is concept drift? -> \\\(P\(y|x\)\\\) changes over time.) Tj
T*
(19. How to choose eval metric under imbalance? -> PR-AUC/recall@precision + business-cost) Tj
T*
(thresholds.) Tj
T*
(20. Staff-level escalation trigger? -> when metric gain conflicts with safety/cost/latency) Tj
T*
(guardrails.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
