T*
() Tj
T*
(1. **Define** the concept precisely.) Tj
T*
(2. Give **one intuition/example**.) Tj
T*
(3. Add **one equation/metric**.) Tj
T*
(4. State **trade-offs** and failure modes.) Tj
T*
(5. End with **how you'd validate** in production.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This format avoids rambling and signals senior depth quickly.) Tj
T*
